From ed24b9c2948272270e94af8b5ed156db22bc3728 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mini <mini@local>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:37:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] Style Markdown preview like VS Code with Cmd-M toggle
 and bounded image cache

Adds Cmd-M side-by-side preview toggle, VS Code typography/spacing, and
PreviewImageCache with frame-deferred sweeping (preventing eviction on
double-render or zero-width layout) and memory reclamation on close.
